. What is Generative AI? Key Concepts and Terminology 

Generative AI refers to artificial intelligence systems that can create new content—such as text, images, audio, or code—that often appears indistinguishable from content created by humans. These systems learn patterns from existing data and use that knowledge to generate new, original outputs. 

                                      

