Recurrent Neural Networks (RNNs) 

Natural Language Processing (NLP): Language translation, sentiment analysis, and chatbots. 

Time Series Forecasting: Predicting stock prices, weather, or energy consumption. 

Speech Recognition: Converting spoken words into text (e.g., Siri, Google Assistant). 

